ser-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> leren vaak om </span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">persoonlijke, professionele en identiteitsontwikkeling</span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">. Studenten brengen hun eigen kennis, ervaringen en leerbehoeften in. Toetsing zou dus ruimte moeten bieden aan diversiteit: het moet studenten uitdagen om zich te ontwikkelen, in plaats van hen te beperken. Dit vraagt om toetsing </span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">om te leren</span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> (in plaats van toetsing als eindstation) en een benadering die ook verschillen tussen studenten waardeert (‘assessment </span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW83798380 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-